<span id="S4.T1.2.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T1.2.6.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Successful pickup</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
